WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 8=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:52.120 --> 01:53.159
It smells wonderful.

01:55.120 --> 01:57.519
There's a plum tree
in the garden in full bloom.

01:57.680 --> 01:58.760
The fragrance is so rich,

01:59.640 --> 02:01.239
so I gathered some fallen blossoms

02:01.544 --> 02:02.904
and brought them for you.

02:15.320 --> 02:16.392
Tonight, the two of us...

02:21.280 --> 02:23.759
Tonight, when we get back,
we can each take some

02:23.816 --> 02:25.080
and put them by our pillows.

02:25.090 --> 02:26.780
We're sure
to have sweet dreams all night.

02:37.680 --> 02:38.280
Come in.

03:04.008 --> 03:05.432
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

03:06.560 --> 03:09.599
Tomorrow is my mother's
fiftieth birthday.

03:10.560 --> 03:12.400
All the ladies
and young women in the city

03:12.696 --> 03:14.840
will be going
to the Zhao Residence to celebrate.

03:15.759 --> 03:18.599
Zijin and Nanny Feng
will certainly be going.

03:23.719 --> 03:25.159
After giving it some thought,

03:27.080 --> 03:28.439
I've chosen the three of you

03:28.800 --> 03:30.280
to accompany me to the banquet.

03:32.936 --> 03:35.160
- Thank you, Young Madam.
- Thank you, Young Madam.

03:39.280 --> 03:40.599
Once we enter the Zhao Residence,

03:41.400 --> 03:44.759
you must follow instructions
in everything I say and do.

03:45.840 --> 03:47.680
You are not to act on your own.

03:51.919 --> 03:53.960
If you think First Madam
will protect you

03:55.120 --> 03:57.039
and disregard what I say...

04:05.240 --> 04:06.599
If I could deal with Ji'er,

04:07.960 --> 04:09.599
I can deal with you, too.

04:27.740 --> 04:29.839
(Jinling Zhao Residence.
First-Rank Scholar)

04:29.839 --> 04:30.759
Madam Zhao.

04:31.600 --> 04:33.199
(Zhao Residence Birthday Banquet)
May your blessings be endless,

04:33.199 --> 04:34.420
(Women's Section)
and your life be long.

04:34.439 --> 04:35.879
May we all share in the joy.

04:37.759 --> 04:38.879
Ladies.

04:39.279 --> 04:40.040
Congratulations.

04:40.088 --> 04:41.550
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

04:41.959 --> 04:42.279
Come.

04:42.920 --> 04:44.639
- Congratulations.
- Ladies.

04:45.288 --> 04:46.510
May everything go smoothly.

04:46.959 --> 04:48.560
Congratulations, Madam.

04:49.439 --> 04:51.199
Wishing you good health and a long life.

04:51.199 --> 04:53.439
(Longevity)

04:53.440 --> 04:54.520
May we all share in the joy.

04:59.000 --> 05:01.839
(Be my ears and eyes.)

05:02.879 --> 05:05.240
(Everything you hear
while you're with Zhao Xingtang,)

05:05.279 --> 05:06.439
(and everything you see,)

05:06.720 --> 05:07.959
(report it all to me.)

05:14.140 --> 05:14.940
All right.

05:30.800 --> 05:31.639
Xingtang.

05:33.120 --> 05:35.079
Why didn't your husband come?

05:37.256 --> 05:38.712
(Zhao Xinghui, Zhao Xingtang's Cousin)
Today is

05:38.744 --> 05:40.312
(Young Lady of the Zhao Family's Second Branch)
Aunt's fiftieth birthday.

05:40.720 --> 05:42.079
Even my husband

05:42.160 --> 05:43.959
came with me to celebrate her birthday.

05:45.279 --> 05:46.560
Why did you

05:46.680 --> 05:48.680
come back all by yourself?

05:49.360 --> 05:50.959
What do you mean, all by herself?

05:51.399 --> 05:52.680
Don't I count?

05:54.720 --> 05:55.519
Madam Wu.

05:55.959 --> 05:57.240
Send a maid

05:57.319 --> 05:59.600
to bring all three young ladies
from our Lin family here.

06:00.519 --> 06:01.720
We wouldn't want anyone saying

06:01.759 --> 06:04.399
my daughter-in-law came all by herself.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.120
If men don't go out and work hard,

06:13.160 --> 06:15.160
how are they supposed
to rise through the ranks?

06:16.519 --> 06:17.759
Surely you don't think

06:17.920 --> 06:20.240
a man can become an assistant commander

06:20.560 --> 06:22.879
by staying home with his wife,
eating and drinking all day?

06:25.480 --> 06:26.759
No wonder your husband...

06:31.480 --> 06:32.279
Listen to me.

06:32.879 --> 06:33.800
I deserve a slap.

06:35.439 --> 06:36.720
Please don't take offense.

06:41.160 --> 06:44.279
My daughter has
been pampered since childhood.

06:44.560 --> 06:46.199
I'm sorry you've had to fuss over her.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.680
With her looks and figure,

06:49.752 --> 06:51.120
it's not the fuss that costs me.

06:51.439 --> 06:52.720
It's all the fabric.

06:56.519 --> 06:57.439
Whenever

06:57.480 --> 06:58.839
I see her,

06:58.920 --> 07:00.360
I can eat an extra bowl of rice.

07:00.639 --> 07:02.800
Just look how much fuller I've gotten.

07:02.920 --> 07:04.800
No wonder I need so much fabric.

07:07.759 --> 07:09.279
If you keep teasing me,

07:09.519 --> 07:12.279
my sisters are going to laugh at me.

07:37.279 --> 07:38.839
If you have something to attend to,

07:38.950 --> 07:40.328
there's no need to stay with us.

07:42.079 --> 07:42.959
It's nothing.

07:43.560 --> 07:45.800
The servants
are making a fuss over nothing.

07:46.279 --> 07:48.920
They came rushing over
some trivial matter.

07:49.480 --> 07:51.600
It would only
make everyone laugh if I told you,

07:52.079 --> 07:53.199
so let's not mention it.

07:55.160 --> 07:56.000
You

07:56.000 --> 07:58.279
need to learn from me
how to take it easy.

07:58.639 --> 07:59.639
I simply made up my mind

07:59.672 --> 08:02.632
and handed the household authority
tokens straight to my daughter-in-law.

08:02.696 --> 08:04.760
(Gan Yingzi, Zhao Xingtang's Sister-in-Law)
Whatever trivial matters come up,

08:04.792 --> 08:06.240
none of them ever reach me.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.360
Easy for you to say.

08:08.920 --> 08:11.839
You'd need a daughter-in-law
as capable as yours.

08:12.480 --> 08:14.399
And you'd need to be like Madam Qin,

08:14.439 --> 08:16.180
knowing how to care
for your daughter-in-law

08:16.199 --> 08:17.480
and always standing up for her.

08:18.199 --> 08:19.519
That's right.

08:21.160 --> 08:21.839
By the way,

08:22.279 --> 08:24.639
I specially had the kitchen prepare

08:24.640 --> 08:26.168
some nourishing soups for the winter.

08:26.510 --> 08:27.544
Everyone, have a taste

08:27.639 --> 08:29.240
and see if they're to your liking.

08:30.120 --> 08:30.839
Go on, try some.

08:30.920 --> 08:31.360
All right.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.080
First Madam.

08:36.519 --> 08:37.919
My stomach doesn't feel well.

08:38.159 --> 08:39.799
I drank too much tea just now.

08:39.919 --> 08:40.879
I'll be right back.

08:56.679 --> 08:57.960
Young Madam is coming out.

08:58.000 --> 08:58.519
Let's go.

09:14.960 --> 09:15.399
Let's go.

09:32.344 --> 09:33.150
What's the matter?

09:36.424 --> 09:38.360
This morning, Aunt Qian
brought Young Master Qian

09:38.376 --> 09:39.960
to wish First Madam a happy birthday.

09:39.976 --> 09:42.200
The servants at the gate
didn't know what was going on

09:42.248 --> 09:43.816
and let them in without question.

09:46.120 --> 09:47.440
First Madam couldn't
very well turn them away,

09:47.440 --> 09:48.830
but she was afraid
Master would find out,

09:48.840 --> 09:51.240
so she had Madam Li
set up a separate table for them.

09:51.288 --> 09:53.440
Young Master Qian
had a few drinks to drown his sorrows,

09:53.450 --> 09:55.780
then started crying and making a scene,
demanding to see you.

09:55.799 --> 09:57.870
The servants took
their eyes off him for just a moment,

09:57.880 --> 09:59.416
and Young Master Qian disappeared.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.220
Madam Li was afraid

10:00.230 --> 10:01.960
he might wander
to the front in his confusion

10:01.960 --> 10:03.200
and disturb the guests,

10:03.270 --> 10:05.320
so she quickly
sent more people to look for him.

10:05.330 --> 10:06.150
But strangely enough,

10:06.160 --> 10:08.670
they've been searching all this time
and still haven't found him.

10:08.680 --> 10:10.200
Shaoze isn't that foolish.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.600
He would never go
to the front and cause a scene.

10:13.799 --> 10:15.279
The courtyard where he used to stay?

10:16.200 --> 10:17.639
And the one where I used to live?

10:17.759 --> 10:18.639
We've checked both.

10:18.960 --> 10:19.679
He wasn't there.

10:22.440 --> 10:23.600
Those servants are useless.

10:23.639 --> 10:25.440
You and Zijin split up
and search again.

10:25.559 --> 10:27.440
Maybe he's hiding in some little corner,

10:29.384 --> 10:30.750
just like when we were children

10:32.080 --> 10:33.120
playing hide-and-seek.

10:34.320 --> 10:35.559
If Zijin and I both leave,

10:35.639 --> 10:37.519
there'll be no one here
to attend to you.

10:37.848 --> 10:39.528
Whether it's appropriate or not,

10:39.840 --> 10:42.279
it would draw far too much attention.

10:42.320 --> 10:43.559
That Lucao

10:43.600 --> 10:45.704
has probably run off
somewhere to shirk her duties.

10:45.710 --> 10:46.960
Now that we need her,

10:46.960 --> 10:48.120
she's nowhere to be found.

10:54.639 --> 10:55.279
Young Madam.

10:55.320 --> 10:56.080
Young Madam.

10:57.440 --> 10:58.080
All right.

11:01.160 --> 11:02.270
Now that they're both here,

11:03.080 --> 11:04.000
you two hurry and go.

11:09.279 --> 11:10.080
- Yes.
- Yes.

12:27.279 --> 12:31.519
Nurture the heart
through poetry, books, and farming.

12:31.519 --> 12:32.559
(Zhao Residence Birthday Banquet,
Men's Section)

12:32.559 --> 12:36.360
Uphold family traditions,
propriety, and moral principles.

12:36.940 --> 12:39.940
(Fang Yu, Courtesy Name Shouyi,
Renowned Scholar of Qixia Academy)

12:46.320 --> 12:47.480
I thought

12:47.592 --> 12:50.216
(Zhao Xuede, Zhao Xingtang's Father)
you wouldn't be able to come today.

12:50.290 --> 12:53.528
(Sixth-Rank Judicial Officer, Zhejiang)
I didn't expect you not only to come,

12:53.530 --> 12:56.520
(Provincial Administration Commission)
but also to bring Scholar Shouyi here.

12:56.536 --> 12:58.960
You've truly gone to great lengths.

13:00.519 --> 13:02.080
Today is my mother-in-law's birthday.

13:02.519 --> 13:03.919
How could I neglect proper courtesy?

13:05.759 --> 13:08.840
Scholar Shouyi is a man
of profound learning

13:08.919 --> 13:10.080
and great virtue and prestige.

13:10.879 --> 13:13.480
If we can ensure
he leaves satisfied today,

13:14.648 --> 13:16.240
then when Grandfather takes up the post

13:16.240 --> 13:18.296
of chief compiler
of the Compendium of Literature,

13:19.080 --> 13:20.279
we'll have his support.

13:22.200 --> 13:22.799
Today,

13:23.039 --> 13:26.639
I will certainly not let
your thoughtful efforts go to waste.

14:05.300 --> 14:10.940
(Ten Thousand Volumes Library)

14:10.940 --> 14:14.900
(Zhao Residence Library)

14:37.672 --> 14:39.320
There were too many people inside.

14:39.944 --> 14:42.088
After being in there so long,
my head started to ache,

14:43.368 --> 14:44.910
so I thought I'd come out for a walk.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.879
Before I knew it, I'd come this far.

14:49.559 --> 14:50.320
Lanxiang.

14:51.912 --> 14:53.650
The soles
of these shoes are a little thin.

14:54.200 --> 14:55.320
My feet have gone numb.

14:56.279 --> 14:58.120
Go back and bring me
a pair with thicker soles.

14:59.480 --> 14:59.919
Yes.

15:17.000 --> 15:17.759
Wait here.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.790
Excuse me, please let me through.

16:50.799 --> 16:51.559
I'm in a hurry...

16:55.360 --> 16:57.000
Jiugao, you...

17:07.039 --> 17:07.880
Where is

17:08.920 --> 17:09.680
Young Madam?

17:13.960 --> 17:14.799
The library.

17:28.200 --> 17:29.519
If you want to stay alive,

17:30.240 --> 17:31.240
don't go back.

17:47.119 --> 17:48.839
Xiaolian wants to live, too.

18:01.500 --> 18:06.900
(Zhao Gang,
Zhao Xingtang's Elder Brother)

18:13.319 --> 18:15.599
My father inscribed
this twenty years ago

18:15.680 --> 18:17.960
when this garden was built.

18:21.080 --> 18:22.312
The sentiment is admirable,

18:23.680 --> 18:24.319
and so is

18:25.240 --> 18:25.880
the calligraphy.

18:32.759 --> 18:34.079
Grandfather loves reading

18:35.359 --> 18:38.079
and always urges
the family to study hard.

18:38.440 --> 18:40.240
There's also a library here,

18:40.240 --> 18:41.384
with old books Grandfather

18:41.432 --> 18:43.480
collected from all over.

18:46.119 --> 18:47.599
May I have a look?

18:47.759 --> 18:49.839
Of course.

18:50.720 --> 18:51.400
Scholar Shouyi,

18:51.440 --> 18:52.119
please.

18:54.319 --> 18:55.079
Very well.

18:55.080 --> 18:55.864
I'll lead the way.

18:57.880 --> 18:59.559
This way, please.

19:49.960 --> 19:50.759
Shaoze.

19:52.519 --> 19:53.559
Shaoze.

19:58.920 --> 19:59.680
Xingtang.

20:00.279 --> 20:01.039
You...

20:02.599 --> 20:03.400
Shaoze.

20:04.240 --> 20:05.544
I waited for you half the night.

20:05.592 --> 20:07.448
Why did it take you
so long to sneak out?

20:10.400 --> 20:11.160
Fool.

20:12.440 --> 20:14.599
That was so many years ago.

20:16.039 --> 20:16.920
We...

20:18.880 --> 20:20.720
haven't been here in almost seven years.

20:37.400 --> 20:39.000
You married into the Lin family,

20:40.024 --> 20:41.880
and I was driven out
of the Zhao Residence.

20:44.599 --> 20:45.400
The child...

20:47.279 --> 20:48.359
Our child...

20:50.079 --> 20:51.119
It was all my fault.

20:51.880 --> 20:52.920
It was all my fault.

20:53.200 --> 20:54.839
I couldn't marry you properly,

20:55.119 --> 20:56.640
so you lost our child

20:56.650 --> 20:57.830
and your health suffered, too!

20:57.839 --> 20:58.440
Shaoze!

21:04.856 --> 21:05.790
It wasn't your fault.

21:06.599 --> 21:07.759
It really wasn't.

21:09.440 --> 21:10.720
It's this world we live in.

21:12.920 --> 21:13.799
It's in the past.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.319
It's all in the past.

21:20.039 --> 21:21.319
I heard

21:22.056 --> 21:24.088
that you and Lin Jinqi
have fallen for each other.

21:24.519 --> 21:26.599
To please you,

21:27.280 --> 21:29.070
Lin Jinqi went
all the way to Qixia Academy

21:29.110 --> 21:31.464
to invite Fang Shouyi
to Aunt's birthday celebration.

21:31.720 --> 21:32.640
Is that true?

21:32.960 --> 21:33.680
Is it?

21:36.776 --> 21:38.904
No wonder you came
to the birthday celebration.

21:39.640 --> 21:40.440
Where did you

21:40.440 --> 21:42.000
hear such nonsense?

21:42.640 --> 21:43.799
Why would Fang Shouyi

21:43.799 --> 21:45.640
come to celebrate my mother's birthday?

21:46.480 --> 21:48.519
And why would
Lin Jinqi try to please me?

21:49.039 --> 21:51.039
He's trying to please Grandfather.

21:52.920 --> 21:53.680
Xingtang.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.279
You can't abandon me.

21:58.279 --> 21:59.440
You can't abandon me.

22:02.079 --> 22:04.680
Shaoze, this isn't the time.

22:04.920 --> 22:05.519
Shaoze.

22:05.519 --> 22:06.759
I can't lose you.

22:06.880 --> 22:07.559
Xingtang.

22:07.799 --> 22:08.880
I can't lose you.

22:13.079 --> 22:14.240
You can't leave me.

22:17.000 --> 22:18.160
You can't leave me.

22:39.599 --> 22:40.359
Xiaolian.

22:41.480 --> 22:42.279
Let's go.

22:43.720 --> 22:44.480
Young Madam said

22:44.519 --> 22:45.440
we mustn't wander off.

22:45.559 --> 22:47.000
She ordered us to wait for her here.

22:47.160 --> 22:47.720
Sir.

22:47.920 --> 22:49.359
I'm not boasting,

22:50.120 --> 22:51.450
but you won't find another library

22:51.510 --> 22:53.928
like the Ten Thousand Volumes Library
anywhere in Jiangnan.

22:55.359 --> 22:56.400
Watch your step.

22:58.200 --> 22:58.839
Come.

23:07.039 --> 23:07.839
Don't make a sound.

23:10.240 --> 23:11.119
We're here.

23:11.119 --> 23:12.640
Sir, this is it.

23:13.680 --> 23:14.440
Sir.

23:15.079 --> 23:17.240
I read here every night

23:17.519 --> 23:19.279
and can hardly put my books down.

23:22.319 --> 23:23.039
Everyone,

23:23.240 --> 23:25.599
before us lies centuries of learning.

23:25.640 --> 23:27.480
We must show due respect.

23:29.240 --> 23:30.480
Keep your voices down.

23:31.279 --> 23:32.720
Yes.

23:32.839 --> 23:33.920
Keep your voices down.

23:35.400 --> 23:36.920
Scholar Shouyi, please.

23:42.640 --> 23:43.160
Please.

23:56.160 --> 23:57.519
Hurry!

24:17.720 --> 24:19.350
Why did Young Master suddenly come here?

24:22.720 --> 24:23.720
The back door.

24:24.400 --> 24:25.839
There's only one way in and out.

24:26.960 --> 24:28.519
What if someone comes this way?

24:32.440 --> 24:34.319
(Nanke and Jiugao must be nearby.)

24:34.696 --> 24:37.352
(They must have brought people
from the Zhao family as witnesses.)

24:38.759 --> 24:39.880
(If we stay,)

24:40.279 --> 24:41.519
(we'll die if we're caught.)

24:42.279 --> 24:43.160
(If we leave,)

24:43.680 --> 24:45.240
(we'll still die if we're caught.)

24:45.880 --> 24:46.720
Scholar Shouyi.

24:49.759 --> 24:50.599
This way, sir.

25:02.000 --> 25:03.240
Why would anyone come here now?

25:31.180 --> 25:33.700
(Ten Thousand Volumes Library)

26:29.839 --> 26:30.960
Why won't it open?

26:40.079 --> 26:41.119
Lin Jinqi.

26:55.200 --> 26:55.640
Let's go.

27:02.079 --> 27:02.839
Let's split up.

27:47.440 --> 27:48.319
Scholar Shouyi.

27:48.700 --> 27:51.656
There's a Song dynasty edition of
the Commentary on the Water Classic.

28:01.048 --> 28:03.070
As expected
of Grand Secretary Zhao's collection.

29:45.400 --> 29:46.480
Scholar Shouyi

29:46.559 --> 29:48.599
really is a true lover of books.

29:49.279 --> 29:50.039
Father.

29:50.599 --> 29:52.599
Let's stop pretending.

29:53.160 --> 29:54.319
Go rest inside for a while.

29:55.960 --> 29:56.640
Let's go.

30:53.559 --> 30:55.119
The main gate is the only way out.

32:31.160 --> 32:31.799
Get some rest.

32:31.912 --> 32:32.552
All right.

32:38.720 --> 32:39.400
You...

32:56.279 --> 32:57.759
The air in here is rather stuffy.

32:58.480 --> 33:00.319
Gang, why don't you take Scholar Shouyi

33:00.920 --> 33:02.039
outside for some fresh air?

33:33.759 --> 33:34.759
Scholar Shouyi.

33:36.200 --> 33:39.640
I'll take you outside
for some fresh air.

33:45.759 --> 33:48.680
I happen to be feeling a little dizzy.

33:49.440 --> 33:51.240
I should get some fresh air.

34:16.079 --> 34:17.840
(Lin Jinqi has caught them together.)

34:18.760 --> 34:20.039
(If we're discovered,)

34:20.360 --> 34:21.688
(we'll have no way out alive.)

34:21.880 --> 34:25.079
When Grand Secretary Zhao
built this library,

34:25.760 --> 34:27.320
he put a great deal of thought into it.

34:27.800 --> 34:29.079
I'll have a look around.

34:29.239 --> 34:30.480
When Fengtai comes out,

34:30.920 --> 34:32.079
come and get me.

34:32.760 --> 34:33.360
All right.

34:43.599 --> 34:44.360
What do we do?

34:45.039 --> 34:46.880
If he comes over,
he'll definitely find us.

34:59.800 --> 35:00.719
If you want to live,

35:01.199 --> 35:02.199
do exactly

35:02.199 --> 35:03.079
as I say.

35:14.840 --> 35:15.679
Son-in-law.

35:19.840 --> 35:20.920
I'm not worthy of the honor.

35:25.639 --> 35:26.800
You shameless wretch!

35:29.496 --> 35:30.856
You ungrateful fool!

35:30.920 --> 35:32.310
I'll kick you to death, you wretch!

35:32.320 --> 35:33.320
I'll kick you to death!

35:33.416 --> 35:34.880
If you want to hit someone, hit me.

35:34.920 --> 35:36.159
Get up!

35:36.599 --> 35:38.119
Scholar Shouyi is still outside.

35:44.480 --> 35:45.239
Son-in-law.

35:45.639 --> 35:47.039
Please calm down.

35:47.880 --> 35:49.440
The library door was locked,

35:49.679 --> 35:50.960
yet they still managed to get in.

35:51.480 --> 35:53.480
Clearly, they know this place well

35:53.480 --> 35:55.048
and have done this many times before.

35:55.400 --> 35:56.480
So all these years,

35:57.159 --> 35:59.159
I've been

35:59.199 --> 36:00.599
a cuckold without even knowing it.

36:01.144 --> 36:03.560
You've kept me
in the dark for so long, Father-in-law.

36:05.159 --> 36:05.960
Son-in-law.

36:09.320 --> 36:12.079
I am deeply ashamed.

36:13.320 --> 36:16.199
It's all because I failed
to discipline my daughter properly.

36:16.400 --> 36:18.920
I've wronged you.

36:19.440 --> 36:20.119
Rest assured.

36:20.159 --> 36:21.800
I will give you an explanation today.

36:21.920 --> 36:22.800
I wouldn't dare.

36:23.840 --> 36:25.199
The man kneeling there

36:25.480 --> 36:26.719
is your true son-in-law.

36:31.159 --> 36:32.519
I'll kick you to death, you wretch!

36:32.520 --> 36:34.310
I'll kick you to death,
you ungrateful fool!

36:34.320 --> 36:34.920
Get out!

36:34.920 --> 36:35.679
Hit me.

36:36.136 --> 36:37.670
If you want to hit someone, hit me!

36:38.119 --> 36:38.880
Get out!

36:39.320 --> 36:41.519
The Zhao family took you in,

36:42.320 --> 36:44.280
yet you took advantage of us

36:44.760 --> 36:46.559
and violated a respectable woman.

36:47.039 --> 36:49.280
Today, I'll kill you, you wretch!

36:49.440 --> 36:50.480
I'll kill you, you wretch!

36:50.480 --> 36:51.840
I'll kill you, you ungrateful fool!

36:52.199 --> 36:52.840
Stop hitting him!

36:52.850 --> 36:54.039
Get out of the way, you beast!

36:54.039 --> 36:54.559
No!

36:54.559 --> 36:54.920
Get up!

36:55.039 --> 36:55.639
No!

36:55.639 --> 36:56.199
Uncle!

36:56.239 --> 36:57.559
Uncle!

36:58.159 --> 36:59.079
It wasn't my fault.

36:59.800 --> 37:00.559
It wasn't my fault.

37:01.440 --> 37:02.079
It was Xingtang.

37:02.200 --> 37:02.880
It was Xingtang.

37:03.199 --> 37:04.719
Xingtang brought me here!

37:04.880 --> 37:06.239
She was the one who kissed me!

37:06.840 --> 37:08.000
It was her!

37:08.199 --> 37:09.280
It was all because of her!

37:09.816 --> 37:10.760
I didn't want this.

37:11.199 --> 37:11.760
I didn't.

37:12.760 --> 37:13.840
She seduced me!

37:13.920 --> 37:14.800
She seduced me!

37:14.800 --> 37:15.719
Nonsense!

37:25.544 --> 37:26.536
This is all your fault!

37:26.800 --> 37:27.960
Uncle, stop hitting me!

37:28.616 --> 37:29.528
You ungrateful fool!

37:29.592 --> 37:30.550
Stop hitting me, Uncle!

37:31.519 --> 37:32.039
It hurts!

37:34.360 --> 37:35.920
Stop hitting me, Uncle!

37:37.480 --> 37:38.880
You ungrateful fool!

37:47.440 --> 37:48.840
I'll beat you to death!

37:55.832 --> 37:56.960
Now that it's come to this,

37:57.704 --> 37:59.710
I no longer wish
to argue over who's at fault.

37:59.880 --> 38:01.880
I only want
to settle this as soon as possible.

38:03.000 --> 38:05.119
First, I'll give Zhao
a letter of repudiation

38:06.079 --> 38:07.519
and cast her out for adultery.

38:08.400 --> 38:09.159
No.

38:09.960 --> 38:11.000
Absolutely not.

38:11.480 --> 38:12.239
Son-in-law....

38:13.480 --> 38:14.880
Fengtai.

38:15.880 --> 38:18.159
For the sake
of our families' friendship,

38:18.280 --> 38:20.440
please spare
the Zhao family this disgrace.

38:28.280 --> 38:29.920
Second, Zhao could die suddenly.

38:30.800 --> 38:33.000
The Lin family
would arrange her funeral,

38:34.000 --> 38:35.000
but her coffin

38:35.416 --> 38:37.656
would not be allowed
into the ancestral burial ground.

38:46.039 --> 38:46.800
This

38:47.480 --> 38:49.159
wouldn't be
appropriate either, would it?

38:50.008 --> 38:51.920
Since she was properly
married into your family,

38:52.760 --> 38:55.064
how could she be denied burial
in the ancestral grounds?

38:56.280 --> 38:57.760
It would certainly invite gossip.

39:01.400 --> 39:03.639
Then there's only one option left.

39:06.392 --> 39:08.456
Zhao and I
will divorce by mutual consent.

39:10.960 --> 39:12.960
For the sake
of our families' friendship,

39:13.199 --> 39:14.599
the divorce agreement will state

39:14.800 --> 39:16.280
that neither party is at fault,

39:16.320 --> 39:17.679
due to irreconcilable differences.

39:17.680 --> 39:19.470
From this day forward,
we will part in peace

39:19.480 --> 39:21.064
and each be free to find another match.

39:23.480 --> 39:24.440
This...

39:25.800 --> 39:27.224
Since you won't agree, Master Zhao,

39:27.599 --> 39:30.079
I'll have no choice but to risk
a feud between our families

39:30.440 --> 39:31.880
and write a letter of repudiation.

39:32.599 --> 39:33.440
The Lin family

39:33.944 --> 39:35.480
isn't afraid of being called cuckolds.

39:35.800 --> 39:38.599
So the Zhao family shouldn't fear
what people will say, either.

39:40.400 --> 39:41.199
Mutual divorce.

39:42.880 --> 39:43.880
Mutual divorce.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.679
I only hope

39:46.000 --> 39:48.000
this can be handled quietly.

39:48.719 --> 39:50.800
It must not affect
Old Master Zhao in any way.

39:53.800 --> 39:55.800
The friendship
between the Lin and Zhao families

39:55.840 --> 39:56.960
has nothing to do with Zhao.

39:58.000 --> 39:59.880
Since I invited
Scholar Shouyi here today,

40:00.232 --> 40:01.510
I'll make sure you're satisfied.

40:03.752 --> 40:05.630
Brush, ink, paper,
and inkstone are all here.

40:06.616 --> 40:08.480
Master Zhao, please put
your promise in writing

40:08.679 --> 40:09.760
as proof.

40:10.199 --> 40:12.519
Only then will I leave.

40:13.280 --> 40:14.039
Otherwise,

40:15.000 --> 40:16.679
we can remain here

40:17.384 --> 40:19.280
until the guests outside
come looking for us.

40:38.540 --> 40:41.860
(Zhao Xuede)

40:52.980 --> 40:57.500
(Zhao Xuede)

41:45.460 --> 41:54.300
(Zhao Xuede)

42:03.519 --> 42:04.400
Lin Fengtai.

42:05.719 --> 42:06.840
I will remember

42:08.239 --> 42:09.559
what happened today.

42:12.536 --> 42:14.760
You still have family matters
to attend to, Master Zhao.

42:15.519 --> 42:16.800
I won't intrude any longer.

42:22.559 --> 42:23.440
I'll take my leave.

42:35.320 --> 42:35.840
Jinqi.

42:39.800 --> 42:40.639
Father...

42:42.616 --> 42:43.590
Your father is inside.

42:44.104 --> 42:45.070
I'll keep watch here.

42:45.360 --> 42:46.119
Go in and see

42:46.320 --> 42:47.159
if he needs any help.

42:47.320 --> 42:48.719
All right.

42:59.719 --> 43:00.840
Where is Scholar Shouyi?

43:05.100 --> 43:07.540
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:09.320 --> 43:10.960
If you want more choices

43:11.639 --> 43:12.840
and more freedom,

43:14.159 --> 43:15.239
you need to be capable,

43:15.920 --> 43:17.440
to be able to serve your masters well

43:17.880 --> 43:19.199
and earn their regard.

43:20.360 --> 43:21.360
If you're fortunate,

43:21.784 --> 43:23.672
you may not only
receive your master's favor

43:23.719 --> 43:24.920
and regain your indenture,

43:25.440 --> 43:27.119
but also build a life of your own.

43:43.540 --> 43:47.660
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:50.500 --> 43:55.020
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

43:56.300 --> 44:00.220
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:00.900 --> 44:03.660
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:04.380 --> 44:06.700
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:06.700 --> 44:09.780
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:11.300 --> 44:15.540
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:18.460 --> 44:22.620
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:24.420 --> 44:27.980
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:27.980 --> 44:31.540
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:32.340 --> 44:38.020
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:38.380 --> 44:42.700
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:43.060 --> 44:46.020
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:46.020 --> 44:49.780
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:49.780 --> 44:52.660
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:52.660 --> 44:56.740
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

44:56.740 --> 45:00.100
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:00.100 --> 45:03.860
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:03.860 --> 45:07.860
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

